 egan  for mark's part he just tries to keep a  positive attitude and assumes the work  they're doing is important now what are  they doing their department is macro  data refinement and they're just sorting  unintelligible random numbers but when  you look at them for a while groups of  numbers evoke different emotions like  group 1 numbers are scary it sounds  ridiculous until you see it for yourself  it's clearly encrypted somehow so they  have no idea what they're sorting dylan  thinks they're clearing the sea of  killer eels but it's probably not that  now mark's outside life is not that  exciting his wife died in a car crash a  few years back and he's mostly just  depressed he has a funny pregnant sister  though who he loves and her husband is a  hilariously insufferable  pseudo-intellectual but the big shake-up  comes when he gets a visit from his work  friend petey he's gone through  reintegration to undo his severance and  it's like look it's bad down there and  lumen's up to no good i'm caught up in a  corporate conspiracy they're out to kill  me mark's like look man i don't know you  if we're best friends i guess you can  crash here for a while but i don't want  to get involved but he's already  involved because his nice old lady  neighbor mrs selvig is his boss mrs  cobell and yeah she's got a key to his  house and like snoops around to keep  tabs on him she doesn't find pd but  reintegration is rough eventually he  wanders off and dies of a brain aneurysm  and someone keeps calling pd's phone but  mark ignores it for now inside hely  refuses to work she keeps trying to find  ways to tell her audi she quits  eventually she causes enough trouble  she's punished with a timeout in the  break room she's forced to read this  weirdly religious apology over and over  again a thousand times until she means  it but she's not broken she's madder  than ever takes her fingers hostage and  demands to make a video telling her audi  how awful it is here but her audi sends  her back down with a response video look  you don't get to make the decisions  you're not a real person not a real  person am i well hell is going to show  her she tries to hang herself in the  elevator so her audi wakes up with a  nasty surprise they're able to save her  in time though she survives and even  after that her audi still sends her back  in this really troubles mark he drops  the professional persona and tries to  connect with heli person to person and  there's been a couple of other big  shake-ups mark found that petey was  trying to map the hallways very much  against the rules mark's brother-in-law  left him a copy of his new book and  lumen confiscated it to check for  messages but they accidentally left it  out where the severed workers found it  and they've never seen any book except  the company handbook the book is  hilariously bad pretentious self-help  dribble but to these innies who have  never read anything before it blows  their minds another big shake-up comes  when macro data bumps into another  department yes that's christopher walken  bert g of optics and design they're in  charge of deciding where to hang the  weirdly religious corporate art but  coincidentally irving bumped into him  earlier and these two bonded over their  love of art and cure egan these two  continue to visit and get an office  flirtation going yes it's a super cute  old dude romance dylan doesn't trust o  and d though there's rumors that years  ago they attacked macro data but turns  out o d heard rumors macro data attacked  them seems like management's playing  them against each other heli's being  monitored now by their wellness director  miss casey who they sometimes meet with  for these corporate scripted wellness  sessions a hug is available upon request  but mark spills some coffee on her  notebook to get her out of there for a  while and he takes heli on a real walk  to talk about things it's like look i'm  with you now this place is messed up so  they 