n  ever but there's still time for some  corporate fun because helyar hits 75  which has earned her an mde a music  dance experience she chooses defiant  jazz and it's an awesome dance party the  most fun you ever have in here but  dylan's still thinking about his son he  snaps an attacks mill chick the mde is  cancelled he fills them all in about the  overtime contingency and it's like look  we can use this to tell people outside  we're prisoners in here and mark has no  idea how his audi got it but he's got  the security key card it's time for a  revolution first step of the plan though  they have to work hard to hit their  quota and earn the much coveted egg bar  and tonight's the big night so as  they're saying goodbye oh helly and mark  start smooching yeah office romance now  because the hit quota dillon g as the  top refiner gets to stay late for the  even more coveted waffle party in the  replica cure mansion they have here and  turns out there's a secret second part  to the waffle party you get to watch a  super weird sexy dance but dylan dips  out he's on a mission goes to the  security office and activates the  overtime contingency and so are innies  wake up in the outside world mark finds  himself at a bit of a party in fact it's  a reading of his favorite book and turns  out the genius authors his own  brother-in-law wow my life's amazing  irving finds out he's a painter but he's  been compulsively painting the same  thing over and over again this scary  dark hallway that's not the break room  hallway what is it well turns out miss  casey was just fired and sent to a  different elevator not the one that goes  up but one that goes further down what  is going on here and why does irving  remember it heli finds herself at a  fancy party and learns that she is  helena egan and this whole party's about  her yes her working there was all for  pro-severance propaganda she briefly  meets her father the current woman ceo  and they're really trying to make  severance a bigger thing in fact earlier  when mark's sister went on a birthing  retreat she made friends with another  pregnant woman and when she ran into her  later absolutely didn't remember her her  husband's a pro severance senator and it  seems like she severed herself to avoid  the pain of giving birth but mark now  runs into a big problem their boss mrs  cobell is at this party yeah as mark's  nice neighbor mrs selvig she's been the  nice baby helper for his sister but any  mark doesn't know that and calls her mrs  cobell oh the jig is up actually the  board had just fired her that day but  she's ready to get her job back and stop  this any rebellion but mark succeeds on  his mission tells his sister everything  you go to expose to the world how bad it  is down there meanwhile irving finds out  he's out he's been researching severance  in fact he's got a map with a bunch of  severed employees on it including bert g  he rushes over there only to find he is  happily married but he's knocking on the  door anyway but hell he's got the  biggest stage she's the keynote speaker  and reveals she's the innie and my  life's a living hell but now mark makes  an epic discovery his dead wife is miss  casey it's a race against time as he  runs out there she's alive and just then  milchik tackles dylan the link is cut  and that's where season one comes to an  end  if you like this recap hit that  subscribe button for more of the best  recaps of tv and movies  [Music]

